|lore=Able leader and captain of the Avenger. Was given his command by Admiral Ozzel. Treated with suspicion by Darth Vader and the Emperor, who distrust Ozzel's close advisors.
|game_text=Adds 2 to power of anything he pilots. When piloting Avenger, that starship is also immune to attrition &lt; 4. You may re-target applicable Utinni Effects to Needa. If in a battle where you choose to forfeit characters, you must forfeit Needa first.
|errata_history=This is the Players Committee's errata card image marked "E" (Holotable image set). It was in the image set when the PC's GitHub repository [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable swccgpc/holotable] was first committed, on 8 July 2018 (commit [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/022435b/Images-HT/starwars/Dagobah-Dark/large/captainneeda.gif 022435b]); that commit imported the existing images, so the image itself may be older (no earlier dated copy found). It was replaced on 23 December 2022 (commit [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/commit/4dee9a1 4dee9a1]) by the image now shown on [[Captain Needa (PC Errata 2)]]. The last sentence is the printed one ("If in a battle where you choose to forfeit characters, you must forfeit Needa first."); the later PC image (now [[Captain Needa (PC Errata 2)]], marked D-E1) replaced it with "While Needa in battle, your other non-'hit' characters here may not be forfeited." The High-Res Scan is strangewayes' print-ready copy of this errata card (HiRez project), which has the same wording.
